# QuizMaster - high score table
#
# Every finished quiz adds one line here. Only the best 10 results are kept,
# highest score first.
#
# The format is:
#   PlayerName|Score|MaxScore|Category|Difficulty|Date
#
# The bars are part of the format, because a name or a category may contain a
# space (for example "General Knowledge"). The game only understands this one
# format, so keep it if you edit the file by hand.
#
# An empty file is fine - the table is then created after the first quiz.
